  "body": "You can work around the limitations currently by manually putting the data into a Blob. \r\n\r\n```js\r\nconst response = await fetch(crossOriginUrl);\r\nconst blob = await response.blob();\r\nconst worker = new Worker(URL.createObjectURL(blob));\r\n```\r\n\r\nAuthors do this today: https://github.com/GoogleChromeLabs/clooney/blob/master/README.md#cdn\r\n\r\nIs seems rather than requiring authors to round trip through a Blob the platform could allow this directly.",
